Notebook[{Cell["Defaults", "ObjectName"], Cell["Defaults is a \
ConfigureVVMFTool setting: <|family -> <|option -> value|>, operation -> \
<|option -> value|>|> with the families \"CG\", \"Representations\", \
\"Models\" and \"Modular\" and operation names such as \
\"UnitarizeRepresentation\". A call uses an explicit option first, then its \
operation's key, then its family's, then the built-in default.", "Usage"], 
  Cell["Status: Alpha.", "Notes"], Cell["Setting of ConfigureVVMFTool: \
session defaults per option family or per operation, <|family -> <|option -> \
value|>, operation -> <|option -> value|>|>. The families are \"CG\" \
(CGCoefficients, CacheCG, Contractions, ModularTensorProductVectors, \
ModularContractions), \"Representations\" (ComputeGroupRepresentations, \
SetGroupRepresentation, ChangeGroupRepBasis, TransformGroupRepresentations, \
UnitarizeRepresentation, DiagonalizeRepresentationT, DecomposeRepresentation, \
RepresentationTSpectrum, RepresentationCharacter, \
RepresentationElementMatrices), \"Models\" (CreateModel, AddModelTerm, \
CoupleContractions, CoupleExpressions, ExtractBilinearMatrix, \
ExtractQuadraticMatrix, ImportModelData, SaveModelData) and \"Modular\" \
(CreateModularModel, ConstructModularForms, SolveModularCoefficients, \
BindModularForms, AddModularFormCouplings, SupplyModularFormSpace, \
ModularFormCandidates, ImportModularFormData, EvaluateModularModel, \
EvaluateModularMassMatrix, ModularFormEvaluate); an operation key names one \
operation (for example \"ComputeGroupRepresentations\"). Each Defaults \
setting replaces the previous one as a whole (Defaults -> <||> clears it); \
the CG family's FieldMethod and Verification are stored in the flat keys and \
are not cleared with it.", "Notes"], Cell["An association of families or \
operation names to associations of options and values.", "Notes"], 
  Cell["A call uses an explicit option first, then its operation's key, then \
its family's, then the option's built-in default. The Validate functions \
(ValidateCG, ValidateRepresentation, ValidateModel, ...) are checks and \
belong to no family (ValidateCG keeps the flat FieldMethod, as before). Steps \
an operation runs internally (representations a CG call computes, a \
diagonalization inside a modular construction, the form checks of a binding) \
inherit the caller's level: an explicit or session Verification of the call \
is passed on, and with the call at Automatic the step follows its own session \
defaults; the result is marked with the weakest status of what it used. \
Checks whose caller records no status (PrepareModelOutput, the representation \
check that rebinds an archived form on import) always run in full. A family \
Verification also sets how far input is checked where the operation takes \
input: SetGroupRepresentation (supplied matrices) and ImportModelData (a \
file); the results carry the status reached.", "Notes"], 
  Cell["A family value is accepted only when every member that takes the \
option admits it; otherwise ConfigureVVMFTool fails with InvalidOption naming \
the operations that refuse it (set those as operation keys). Settings that \
would make every call of an operation without its own options fail (for \
example NumberField -> False with FieldMethod -> \"Cyclotomic\", or \
Verification -> \"Exact\" with Arithmetic -> \"Numerical\") are refused the \
same way. Method, Normalization, Basis, MethodData, Arithmetic, \
WorkingPrecision, TargetIrreps and SeriesOrder have a per-operation meaning, \
and the options that carry a call's data (Name, Overwrite, Recompute, \
ReplaceBindings, targets, couplings, values, ValidationGroup, ...) are per \
call: operation keys only. The setting survives a package reload; stored \
values the reloaded package refuses are cleared with a notice.", "Notes"], 
  Cell["The CG family's FieldMethod and Verification are the flat keys \
ConfigureVVMFTool[FieldMethod -> ...] and ConfigureVVMFTool[Verification -> \
...], with their earlier reach: FieldMethod for the CG family, Verification \
for CGCoefficients and CacheCG only (the functions built on CG coefficients \
default to Automatic).", "Notes"], Cell["See Also", "SeeAlsoSection"], 
  Cell[TextData[{ButtonBox["ConfigureVVMFTool", BaseStyle -> "Hyperlink", 
      ButtonData -> {"ConfigureVVMFTool.nb", None}], "  |  ", 
     ButtonBox["FieldMethod", BaseStyle -> "Hyperlink", 
      ButtonData -> {"FieldMethod.nb", None}], "  |  ", 
     ButtonBox["Verification", BaseStyle -> "Hyperlink", 
      ButtonData -> {"Verification.nb", None}]}], "SeeAlso"], 
  Cell["Examples Initialization", "ExamplesInitializationSection"], 
  Cell["Open this notebook in its repository location. GAP must be installed; \
LINS is required for its bounded search page. Evaluate the setup before the \
examples.", "ExampleText"], 
  Cell[BoxData[RowBox[{RowBox[{"Get", "[", RowBox[{"FileNameJoin", "[", 
          RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{RowBox[{"Nest", "[", RowBox[{"DirectoryName", 
                  ",", RowBox[{"NotebookFileName", "[", "]"}], ",", "5"}], 
                "]"}], ",", "\"Kernel\"", ",", "\"init.m\""}], "}"}], "]"}], 
        "]"}], ";"}]], "ExampleInitialization"], 
  Cell["Basic Examples", "PrimaryExamplesSection"], 
  Cell[BoxData[RowBox[{"Block", "[", 
      RowBox[{RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"VVMFTool`Private`$Configuration", "=", 
            "VVMFTool`Private`$Configuration"}], "}"}], ",", 
        RowBox[{RowBox[{"ConfigureVVMFTool", "[", RowBox[{"Defaults", 
              "\[Rule]", RowBox[{"Association", "[", RowBox[
                 {"\"Representations\"", "\[Rule]", RowBox[{"Association", 
                    "[", RowBox[{"FieldMethod", "\[Rule]", 
                      "\"Cyclotomic\""}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}], "[", 
          "Defaults", "]"}]}], "]"}]], "Input", 
   CellTags -> "VerifiedExample"], 
  Cell[BoxData[RowBox[{"Association", "[", RowBox[{"\"Representations\"", 
        "\[Rule]", RowBox[{"Association", "[", RowBox[{"FieldMethod", 
            "\[Rule]", "\"Cyclotomic\""}], "]"}]}], "]"}]], "Output"], 
  Cell["Possible Issues", "ExampleSection"], Cell["Invalid input returns a \
structured Failure. Check FailureQ before using the result.", "ExampleText"], 
  Cell[BoxData[RowBox[{"FailureQ", "[", 
      RowBox[{"Block", "[", RowBox[
         {RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"VVMFTool`Private`$Configuration", "=", 
              "VVMFTool`Private`$Configuration"}], "}"}], ",", 
          RowBox[{"ConfigureVVMFTool", "[", RowBox[{"Defaults", "\[Rule]", 
              RowBox[{"Association", "[", RowBox[{"\"Modular\"", "\[Rule]", 
                  RowBox[{"Association", "[", RowBox[{"Verification", 
                      "\[Rule]", "\"Exact\""}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], 
        "]"}], "]"}]], "Input", CellTags -> "VerifiedErrorExample"], 
  Cell[BoxData["True"], "Output"], Cell["Related Guides", 
   "MoreAboutSection"], 
  Cell[TextData[{ButtonBox["Constructing finite groups", 
      BaseStyle -> "Hyperlink", ButtonData -> 
       {"../../Tutorials/ConstructingFiniteGroups.nb", None}]}], 
   "MoreAbout"], Cell[CellGroupData[{Cell["Metadata", "MetadataSection"], 
     Cell["Symbol", "Categorization", CellLabel -> "Entity Type"], 
     Cell["VVMFTool", "Categorization", CellLabel -> "Paclet Name"], 
     Cell["VVMFTool`", "Categorization", CellLabel -> "Context"], 
     Cell["VVMFTool/ref/Defaults", "Categorization", CellLabel -> "URI"]}, 
    Closed]]}, WindowTitle -> "Defaults \[LongDash] VVMFTool", 
 WindowSize -> {1000, 850}, TaggingRules -> <|"Paclet" -> "VVMFTool", 
   "Status" -> "Alpha"|>, StyleDefinitions -> FrontEnd`FileName[{"Wolfram"}, 
   "FunctionPageStylesExt.nb", CharacterEncoding -> "UTF-8"]]
